\newlabel{tab:platform-geometry}{{3.4}{7}{Platform geometry and drivetrain limits used by the wheel-odometry and EKF baselines. \texttt {AckermannSteering} exposes no noise parameter, so the simulated encoders and odometry are noise free at source}{table.3.4}{}}
